---
// Footer.astro - Pie de Página Oficial en Negro Obsidiana (#030303) con Estructura Editorial de 4 Columnas
---

<footer class="bg-[#030303] text-white pt-20 pb-12 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-[1536px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Grid Principal de 4 Columnas -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-10 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
      <!-- Columna 1: BOOSTED Identidad & Misión (4 Columnas) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <a href="#" class="inline-block mb-6 group" aria-label="Boosted Inicio">
            <img 
              src="/images/logo/logo-white.png" 
              alt="BOOSTED" 
              class="h-8 sm:h-9 w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105"
            />
          </a>

          <p class="font-poppins text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-8">
            Agencia de Automatización y Marketing Digital. Diseñamos ecosistemas digitales conectados con Inteligencia Artificial que eliminan tareas manuales y escalan tus ventas.
          </p>

          <!-- Input Newsletter Minimalista (Estilo Referencia) -->
          <form id="footer-newsletter-form" class="relative max-w-xs mb-8">
            <input 
              type="email" 
              placeholder="Ingresa tu email" 
              required
              class="w-full pl-4 pr-12 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-xs text-white placeholder:text-zinc-500 focus:border-[#26CCCA] focus:outline-none transition-colors"
            />
            <button 
              type="submit" 
              aria-label="Suscribirse al newsletter"
              class="absolute right-1.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white text-[#030303] hover:bg-[#26CCCA] hover:text-[#030303] flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer shadow-sm"
            >
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
              </svg>
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <!-- Redes Sociales Oficiales -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <!-- LinkedIn -->
          <a 
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/boosted-cl" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            aria-label="LinkedIn de Boosted"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-300 hover:text-[#030303] hover:bg-[#26CCCA] hover:border-[#26CCCA] transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.46 10.9v8.37H9.2V10.9H6.46M7.83 6.45a1.62 1.62 0 1 0 0 3.24 1.62 1.62 0 0 0 0-3.24z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Instagram -->
          <a 
            href="https://www.instagram.com/boosted.cl" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            aria-label="Instagram de Boosted"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-300 hover:text-[#030303] hover:bg-[#26CCCA] hover:border-[#26CCCA] transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna 2: Servicios (2.5 Columnas) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
        <h4 class="font-outfit text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-5">
          Servicios
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-poppins text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/servicios-automatizacion" class="hover:text-[#26CCCA] transition-colors">
              Automatización de Procesos
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/servicios-desarrollo-a-medida" class="hover:text-[#26CCCA] transition-colors">
